"You examine the batch and see that the pickling solution has done its job, "
"so you seal the jar up for storage."
msgstr ""
"Examinás la fermentación y ves que el escabeche ha terminado su trabajo, así"
" que sellás el frasco para almacenarlo."

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for fermenting eggs jar.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "The eggs are not done yet."
msgstr "Los huevos todavía no están listos."

#. ~ Description for fermenting eggs jar
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This jar contains a batch of eggs in a pickling solution.  You can seal up "
"the jar once the process is completed."
msgstr ""
"Este frasco contiene una tanda de huevos en escabeche. Podés sellar el jarro"
