#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "Merch"
msgid_plural "Merchs"
msgstr[0] "Merc"
msgstr[1] "Mercs"

#. ~ Description for Merch
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Free Merchant Certified Note, also known by names such as a 'c-note' or "
"'merch', is a currency based on old American bills.  Fifty dollar bills and "
"larger are printed with a promissory note signed by the treasurer of the "
"Free Merchants, along with a complex design.  The note explains that this "
"can be exchanged for food, water, and other services through the Free "
"Merchants in the Refugee Center."
msgstr ""
"Es un Bono Certificado de Mercader Libre, también conocido como la 'nota-c' "
"o 'merc', es una moneda basada en los viejos billetes estadounidenses. Los "
"billetes de 50 o más grandes son impresos con una nota de pagaré firmada por"
" el tesorero de los Mercaderes Libres, en un diseño complejo. La nota "
"explica que esto puede ser canjeado por comida, agua u otros servicios en el"
" Centro de Refugiados de los Mercaderes Libres."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "FlatCoin"
msgid_plural "FlatCoins"
msgstr[0] "FlatCoin"
msgstr[1] "FlatCoins"

#. ~ Description for FlatCoin
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a coin that has been flattened in a novelty coin flattening machine."
"  The machine has been somewhat crudely altered so that the design - which "
"appears to once have been Mickey Mouse - is overlayed with a handwritten "
"emblem of a book.  There is some text that faintly reads 'Campus Exchange "
"Token'."
msgstr ""
"Es una moneda que ha sido aplastada en una novedosa máquina para aplastar "
"monedas. La máquina ha sido alterada para que el diseño - que parece haber "
"sido alguna vez Mickey Mouse - tenga el emblema escrito a mano de un libro. "
"Hay un texto que apensa se lee: 'Ficha de Cambio de Campus'."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "spare parts"
msgid_plural "spare parts"
msgstr[0] "partes de repuesto"
msgstr[1] "partes de repuesto"

#. ~ Description for spare parts
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Items with are not themselves useful but are instead requirements for "
"crafting or repairs"
msgstr ""
"Son objetos que no son útiles así sueltos pero pueden ser necesarios para "
"algunas fabricaciones o reparaciones."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "drive belt"
msgid_plural "drive belts"
msgstr[0] "correa de transmisión"
msgstr[1] "correas de transmisión"

#. ~ Description for drive belt
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A synthetic rubber V-belt with steel reinforcement fibers commonly fitted to"
" engines or other industrial equipment."
msgstr ""
"Es una cinta de goma sintética en V con fibras de acero reforzado que se "
"utiliza normalmente en motores u otros equipos industriales."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "makeshift drive belt"
msgid_plural "makeshift drive belts"
msgstr[0] "correa improvisada de transmisión"
msgstr[1] "correas improvisadas de transmisión"

#. ~ Description for makeshift drive belt
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An improvised belt useful for repairing engines or other industrial "
"equipment when no better alternative is available."
msgstr ""
"Es una correa improvisada que sirve para arreglar motores u otros equipos "
"industriales cuando no encontrás una mejor alternativa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "air filter"
msgid_plural "air filters"
msgstr[0] "filtro de aire"
msgstr[1] "filtros de aire"

#. ~ Description for air filter
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A plastic box containing crêped paper used to filter the air supply for "
"combustion engines or other industrial equipment."
msgstr ""
"Es una caja de plástico que contiene papel crepe que sirve para filtrar el "
"suministro de aire de los motores de combustión o de otros equipos "
"industriales."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "makeshift air filter"
msgid_plural "makeshift air filters"
msgstr[0] "filtro de aire improvisado"
msgstr[1] "filtros de aire improvisados"

#. ~ Description for makeshift air filter
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An improvised air filter useful for repairing engines or other industrial "
"equipment when no better alternative is available."
msgstr ""
"Es un filtro de aire improvisado que sirve para arreglar motores u otros "
"equipos industriales cuando no encontrás una mejor alternativa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "automotive filter"
msgid_plural "automotive filters"
msgstr[0] "filtro automotor"
msgstr[1] "filtros automotores"

#. ~ Description for automotive filter
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A steel can containing filter paper designed for automotive use."
msgstr ""
"Es una lata de acero que tiene papel de filtro diseñado para utilizar en "
"automotores."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "makeshift automotive filter"
msgid_plural "makeshift automotive filters"
msgstr[0] "filtro automotor improvisado"
msgstr[1] "filtros automotores improvisados"

#. ~ Description for makeshift automotive filter
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An improvised automotive filter useful for repairing engines or other "
"industrial equipment when no better alternative is available."
msgstr ""
"Es un filtro automotor improvisado que sirve para arreglar motores u otros "
"equipos industriales cuando no encontrás una mejor alternativa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "glow plug"
msgid_plural "glow plugs"
msgstr[0] "bujía de precalentamiento"
msgstr[1] "bujías de precalentamiento"

#. ~ Description for glow plug
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A cylindrical heating device designed to be screwed in to a diesel engine to"
" aid starting in cold weather."
msgstr ""
"Es un dispositivo cilíndrico de calentamiento diseñado para ser atornillado "
"en un motor diésel para ayudar el arranque bajo climas fríos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "high-pressure pump"
msgid_plural "high-pressure pumps"
msgstr[0] "bomba de alta presión"
msgstr[1] "bombas de alta presión"

#. ~ Description for high-pressure pump
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An complex mechanical pump capable of achieving high pressures.  Far beyond "
"anything you could reasonably improvise."
msgstr ""
"Es una bomba mecánica compleja capaz de alcanzar presiones altas, más allá "
"de cualquier cosa que puedas improvisar."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "mechanical pump"
msgid_plural "mechanical pumps"
msgstr[0] "bomba mecánica"
msgstr[1] "bombas mecánicas"

#. ~ Description for mechanical pump
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An simple cast iron mechanical impeller pump.  It's not good for much of "
"anything on its own."
msgstr ""
"Es un simple impulsor mecánico de hierro de una bomba. Así solo no sirve "
"para mucho que digamos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "small string"
msgid_plural "small strings"
msgstr[0] "soguita"
msgstr[1] "soguitas"

#. ~ Description for small string
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A 6-inch long piece of cotton string."
msgstr "Es un pedazo de soga de algodón de 15 centímetros."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "long string"
msgid_plural "long strings"
msgstr[0] "soga"
msgstr[1] "sogas"

#. ~ Description for long string
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A 3-foot long piece of cotton string.  Disassemble it to cut it into smaller"
" pieces."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de soga de algodón de 90 centímetros. Si lo desarmás, obtenés "
"pedazos más cortos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "short rope"
msgid_plural "short ropes"
msgstr[0] "cuerda corta"
msgstr[1] "cuerdas cortas"

#. ~ Description for short rope
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A six-foot long piece of rope.  Too small to be of much use."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de cuerda de nailon de 1,80 metros. Su tamaño no la hace muy "
"útil, pero sirve para algunas cosas."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "long rope"
msgid_plural "long ropes"
msgstr[0] "cuerda larga"
msgstr[1] "cuerdas largas"

#. ~ Description for long rope
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A 30-foot long rope.  Useful for keeping yourself safe from falls."
msgstr ""
"Una cuerda de nailon de 9 metros. Es útil para mantenerte a salvo de una "
"caída."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "vine"
msgid_plural "vines"
msgstr[0] "liana"
msgstr[1] "lianas"

#. ~ Description for vine
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sturdy 30-foot long vine.  Could easily be used as a rope, but can't be "
"disassembled."
msgstr ""
"Es una liana fuerte de 9 metros. Puede ser usada como cuerda, pero no se "
"puede desarmar."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "short makeshift rope"
msgid_plural "short makeshift ropes"
msgstr[0] "cuerda improvisada corta"
msgstr[1] "cuerdas improvisadas cortas"

#. ~ Description for short makeshift rope
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A six-foot long piece of rough rope, woven from natural cordage.  Useful for"
" some purposes, but not as strong or flexible as proper rope."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de 2 metros de soga simple, tejida con cordaje natural. Es útil"
" para algunos casos, pero no es ni tan fuerte ni tan flexible como una soga "
"apropiada."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "long makeshift rope"
msgid_plural "long makeshift ropes"
msgstr[0] "cuerda improvisada larga"
msgstr[1] "cuerdas improvisadas largas"

#. ~ Description for long makeshift rope
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A 30-foot long rough rope, woven from natural cordage.  Not strong enough to"
" hold up to falls, but still useful for some things."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de casi 10 metros de soga simple, tejida con cordaje natural. "
"No es suficientemente fuerte como para aguantar caídas, pero es útil para "
"algunas cosas."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "makeshift bayonet"
msgid_plural "makeshift bayonets"
msgstr[0] "bayoneta improvisada"
msgstr[1] "bayonetas improvisadas"

#. ~ Description for makeshift bayonet
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A makeshift version of a bayonet that consists of a mere spike with some "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Es una versión improvisada de la bayoneta, que consiste en una simple punta "
"con un poco de soga."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "aluminum ingot"
msgid_plural "aluminum ingots"
msgstr[0] "lingote de aluminio"
msgstr[1] "lingotes de aluminio"

#. ~ Description for aluminum ingot
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small aluminum ingot, standardized for further processing.  Light but "
"durable, this could be cast into various shapes for construction or ground "
"down to a powder, for more... high-profile applications."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño lingote de aluminio, normalizado para un proceso posterior. "
"Ligero pero duradero, puede ser moldeado en diferentes formas para la "
"construcción o molido en polvo, para usos más... notorios."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "radio car box"
msgid_plural "radio car boxes"
msgstr[0] "caja de auto radiocontrolado"
msgstr[1] "cajas de autos radiocontrolados"

#. ~ Description for radio car box
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A RC car, with radio-control and batteries included!  Disassemble to unpack "
"and enjoy."
msgstr ""
"Un auto radiocontrolado, ¡con el control y las baterías incluidas! Hay que "
"desarmarlo para vaciar la caja y disfrutar."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "vehicle alternator"
msgid_plural "vehicle alternators"
msgstr[0] "alternador de vehículo"
msgstr[1] "alternadores de vehículo"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "car alternator"
msgid_plural "car alternators"
msgstr[0] "alternador de auto"
msgstr[1] "alternadores de auto"

#. ~ Description for car alternator
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A standard alternator used to power vehicle electrical systems."
msgstr ""
"Es un alternador estándar que se usa para alimentar los sistemas eléctricos "
"del vehículo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "motorbike alternator"
msgid_plural "motorbike alternators"
msgstr[0] "alternador de moto"
msgstr[1] "alternadores de moto"

#. ~ Description for motorbike alternator
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A compact lightweight alternator used to power small vehicle electrical "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"Es un alternador compacto y liviano que se usa para alimentar pequeños "
"sistemas eléctricos del vehículo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "bicycle alternator"
msgid_plural "bicycle alternators"
msgstr[0] "alternador de bicicleta"
msgstr[1] "alternadores de bicicleta"

#. ~ Description for bicycle alternator
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A very lightweight alternator used to power a bicycle's headlights."
msgstr ""
"Es un alternador muy liviano que se usa para alimentar las luces de una "
"bicicleta."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "truck alternator"
msgid_plural "truck alternators"
msgstr[0] "alternador de camión"
msgstr[1] "alternadores de camión"

#. ~ Description for truck alternator
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A larger and more powerful alternator used to power vehicle electrical "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"Es un alternador más grande y potente que se usa para alimentar sistemas "
"eléctricos del vehículo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "7.5kW generator"
msgid_plural "7.5kW generators"
msgstr[0] "generador de 7.5kW"
msgstr[1] "generadores de 7.5kW"

#. ~ Description for 7.5kW generator
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bulky but efficient electrical generator designed to be attached to an "
"engine."
msgstr ""
"Es un alternador eléctrico grandote pero eficiente diseñado para ser "
"conectado a un motor."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "rebar grate"
msgid_plural "rebar grates"
msgstr[0] "reja de varillas"
msgstr[1] "rejas de varillas"

#. ~ Description for rebar grate
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Interlocked sections of rebar that allows for light and effective "
"reinforcement of vehicle sections."
msgstr ""
"Varillas corrugadas entrelazadas, lo que permite pasar la luz y es un "
"refuerzo efectivo para partes de un vehículo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "shock absorber"
msgid_plural "shock absorbers"
msgstr[0] "amortiguador"
msgstr[1] "amortiguadores"

#. ~ Description for shock absorber
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This makeshift combination of springs and scrap, when attached to a vehicle "
"section, protects that section from impacts.  The springs can absorb a "
"surprising amount of damage."
msgstr ""
"Cuando esta combinación improvisada de chatarra y resortes se pone en un "
"vehículo, protege esa parte de los impactos. Los resortes pueden absorber "
"una cantidad sorprendente de daño."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "massive engine block"
msgid_plural "massive engine blocks"
msgstr[0] "bloque enorme de motor"
msgstr[1] "bloques enormes de motor"

#. ~ Description for massive engine block
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The beginnings of a massive gas or diesel engine.  It's not good for much of"
" anything on its own."
msgstr ""
"Es una pieza primordial de un motor enorme de gas o diesel. Así solo no "
"sirve para mucho que digamos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "large engine block"
