msgstr "Programaste mal el C4-hack; ¡cubrite!"

#. ~ Description for inactive C-4 hack
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an inactive C-4 hack.  C-4 hacks are fist-sized robots that fly "
