#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "A shadow splits from the %s!"
msgstr "¡Una sombra se separa desde el %s!"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"Stop it please\""
msgstr "\"Por favor, detente\""

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"Let us help you\""
msgstr "\"Dejanos ayudarte\""

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"We wish you no harm\""
msgstr "\"No queremos hacerte daño\""

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"Do not fear\""
msgstr "\"No tengas miedo\""

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"We can help you\""
msgstr "\"Podemos ayudarte\""

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"We are friendly\""
msgstr "\"Somos amigos\""

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"Please dont\""
msgstr "\"Por favor, no lo hagas\""

#. ~ Lowercase is intended: they're small voices.
#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"hey, it's gonna be all right!\""
msgstr "\"hey, ¡va a estar todo bien!\""

#. ~ Lowercase is intended: they're small voices.
#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"we'll get through this!\""
msgstr "\"¡vamos a superar esto!\""

#. ~ Lowercase is intended: they're small voices.
#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"i'm here for you!\""
msgstr "\"¡estoy acá para ayudarte!\""

#. ~ Lowercase is intended: they're small voices.
#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"let me help!\""
msgstr "\"¡dejame ayudar!\""

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The slime cleans you out!"
msgstr "¡El slime te deja seco!"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The slime flows over you, but your gouges still ache."
msgstr "El slime fluye sobre vos, pero tus agujeros todavía te duelen."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The slime seals up your leaks!"
msgstr "¡El slime sella tus filtraciones!"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The slime flows over you, but your fluids are still leaking."
msgstr ""
"El slime fluye sobre vos, pero tus fluidos todavía se están filtrando."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "but you grab its arm and flip it to the ground!"
msgstr "¡pero agarrás su brazo y lo lanzás al piso!"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The flip does shock you..."
msgstr "La vuelta te sorprende..."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "but you deftly spin out of its grasp!"
msgstr "¡pero hábilmente girás y te liberás del agarre!"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"Halt and submit to arrest, citizen! The police will be here any moment."
msgstr ""
"¡Detente y entrégate al arresto, ciudadano! La policía estará acá en un "
"momento."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "Please stay in place, citizen, do not make any movements!"
msgstr ""
"Por favor, permanece en tu lugar, ciudadano, ¡no haga ningún movimiento!"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The robot carefully scans you."
msgstr "El robot te escanea cuidadosamente."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The robot carefully scans <npcname>."
msgstr "El robot escanea cuidadosamente a <npcname>."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The riotbot orders you to present your hands and be cuffed."
msgstr "El antidisturbot te ordena que pongas las manos para ser esposado."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "Allow yourself to be arrested."
msgstr "Permitir ser arrestado."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "Resist arrest!"
msgstr "¡Resistir arresto!"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "Feign death."
msgstr "Fingir muerte."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"You deftly slip out of the handcuffs just as the robot closes them.  The "
"robot didn't seem to notice!"
msgstr ""
"Hábilmente, te escapás de las esposas justo cuando el robot las cerraba. ¡El"
" robot parece no haberse dado cuenta!"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The robot puts handcuffs on you."
msgstr "El robot te pone las esposas."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"You are under arrest, citizen.  You have the right to remain silent.  If you"
" do not remain silent, anything you say may be used against you in a court "
"of law."
msgstr ""
"Está bajo arresto, ciudadano. Tiene el derecho de permanecer en silencio. Si"
" no permanece en silencio, todo lo que diga podrá ser usado en su contra en "
"la corte."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"You have the right to an attorney.  If you cannot afford an attorney, one "
"will be provided at no cost to you.  You may have your attorney present "
"during any questioning."
msgstr ""
"Tiene derecho a un abogado. Si no puede pagar un abogado, se le proveerá uno"
" sin costo. Puede tener a su abogado presente durante el interrogatorio."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"If you do not understand these rights, an officer will explain them in "
"greater detail when taking you into custody."
msgstr ""
"Si no entiende estos derechos, un agente se los explicará con mayor detalle "
"cuando sea tomado en custodia."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"Do not attempt to flee or to remove the handcuffs, citizen.  That can be "
"dangerous to your health."
msgstr ""
"No intente huir o quitarse las esposas, ciudadano. Eso puede ser riesgoso "
"para su salud."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"You fall to the ground and feign a sudden convulsive attack.  Though you're "
"obviously still alive, the riotbot cannot tell the difference between your "
"'attack' and a potentially fatal medical condition.  It backs off, signaling"
" for medical help."
msgstr ""
"Te tirás al piso y fingís un repentino ataque de convulsiones. Aunque "
"obviamente todavía estás vivo, el antidisturbot no puede notar la diferencia"
" entre tu 'ataque' y un potencial condición médica fatal. Se retira, "
"buscando ayuda médica."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "Your awkward movements do not fool the riotbot."
msgstr "Tus extraños movimientos no engañan al antidisturbot."

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The robot sprays tear gas!"
msgstr "¡El robot tira gas lacrimógeno!"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "Empty your hands and hold your position, citizen!"
msgstr "¡Vacíe sus manos y mantenga su posición, ciudadano!"

#. ~ Sound of a riotbot using its blinding flash
#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "fzzzzzt"
msgstr "fzzzzzt"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
